## Brain morphometry

Acquisition protocols and scanner vendors varied across datasets  (appendix  2).  Morphometric  feature  extraction from whole-brain T 1 -weighted images was implemented with  the  standard  pipelines  in  the  FreeSurfer  image

![Image](./Ge2024_artifacts/image_000000_bc0e91e382794335f47a4ce3e3e38651cc292a83d948ab1acf54be8dedd04510.png)

![Image](./Ge2024_artifacts/image_000001_89768e92bbb9a9eb41c1d6477de422afb751bf362d7f1b0e35ab8380e4bb8e29.png)

